 ## 3. Sun shaft strength (`Sun Shaft Amount`)
 
+**Retired by default (2026-09-09).** `r_sunshafts` is 0 on ReCS (stock 2); the screen-space
+shafts and everything in this section apply only after `r_sunshafts 1`. God rays now come from
+volumetric fog (`e_VolumetricFog 1`, restart required) with `r_VolumetricFogDownscaledSunShadow 2`
+and `r_VolumetricFogTexScale 6` as ReCS defaults; the density table in 3.1 is still the knob
+for those, and is now the ONLY one. See `ConsoleReference.md`, "Stock engine cvars whose ReCS
+default differs".
+
 **Why it needs measuring.** On the stock path the shaft colour is normalised to unit length, so
 shaft brightness is `SunShafts_RaysAmount` and nothing else, and the working targets are UNORM so
 the mask is a clipped silhouette. On the scene-referred path the colour is the sun's actual
